{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CftKQqVLVJL7R2WkexSkj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Build now, with a narrow scope and a measured rollout\n\n**Recommendation:** Start building. Run the research that's still needed alongside the build rather than before it.\n\n**Why build now**\n- **Demand is proven.** 14 of 120 clinics (12%) already pay for a separate SMS tool and upload a CSV every night to use it. That's clear willingness to pay, and an obvious first group to switch.\n- **The pilot result points the same way as the evidence elsewhere.** No-shows fell 8 points with reminders while the comparison clinics stayed flat. Published healthcare studies usually find reminders cut no-shows by a few points up to about a third.\n- **Low risk.** An SMS-provider integration is standard work and easy to reverse. Three engineers for six weeks is enough for a minimum version: one reminder about 24 hours before, consent and opt-out, per-clinic settings and delivery logs.\n\n**Why the 8-point drop may be too high**\n- The pilot covered only 3 clinics against 3, for 4 weeks.\n- The clinics volunteered, so they may be unusually engaged.\n- Customer success staff wrote the messages by hand, which may work better than templates.\n- Some of the effect may be novelty. Plan around a smaller gain, perhaps 3–5 points.\n\n**Check in weeks 1–2, while building**\n1. **Data:** what share of appointments have a valid mobile number and recorded SMS consent? If it's low, the effect shrinks.\n2. **Compliance:** consent rules for your markets (e.g., TCPA, GDPR/PECR), and keeping health details out of message text.\n3. **Pricing:** cost per SMS, and whether to charge for reminders, include them in the base price or bundle them. Ask the 14 SMS-tool clinics.\n\n**Rollout**\nRelease to clinics in random waves, so the comparison against clinics not yet live gives a reliable effect size. Add two-way replies for \"confirm/cancel\" only after the basic version works."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3195,"cache_read_input_tokens":5086,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3195},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fe7e97e8-f797-4073-88b4-350e9ddf7b3a","uuid":"8b927acf-278e-481e-b7e1-ef79783da15d","timestamp":"2026-10-10T09:27:22.822Z","request_id":"req_011CftKQqGBuqgULJJDnDSG4"}
